{%- comment -%}
  Starlight's LastUpdated.astro: a `lastUpdated` date in the front matter, or with site.last_updated the git step's
  page.updated (Douze plan 3.10). Formatted "%b %e, %Y" (dateStyle medium in English; other languages get the same
  English format until format_date lands). Root class: cid-sl-last-updated.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lu_date = nil -%}
{%- if lastUpdated and lastUpdated != true -%}{%- assign lu_date = lastUpdated -%}{%- elsif site.last_updated and lastUpdated != false -%}{%- assign lu_date = page.updated -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if lu_date -%}
<p class="cid-sl-last-updated">{{ "page.lastUpdated" | t }} <time datetime="{{ lu_date | date_to_xmlschema }}">{{ lu_date | date: "%b %e, %Y" | replace: "  ", " " }}</time></p>
{%- endif -%}
